# B-001: decoded binaries (scripts/decode-assets.mjs). The binaries are
# tracked in this repo, so these rules are no-ops for the tracked copies —
# gitignore never hides a tracked file. They exist for fresh GitHub
# checkouts, where the snapshot transport carries only the .b64 text
# siblings: decode recreates the binaries as untracked files, and without
# these rules every build would dirty the tree with them.
